Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 16:57:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] tests: anti-exfil sign_psbt exchanges and refusals

Cases cover each required form for psbt versions 0 and 2, the accepted sighash
types, and the requests that must fail. Expected signatures come from the
reference signer; the first pass must not ask for approval.
